        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Chinese Chongqing Dog, Kanni\n- Places: China, Tamil Nadu, South India\n- Topics: dog breed origins, uses, hunting, protection\n\nFacts:\n- The Chinese Chongqing Dog was used in its early years for hunting wild boar and rabbits.\n- The Chinese Chongqing Dog is now used in China to protect families and belongings.\n- The Kanni is a rare indigenous South Indian sighthound breed of dog found in the state of Tamil Nadu.\n- The name Kanni means maiden.\n- The Kanni breed is used mainly for coursing game.",
